{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:16 2026-10-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:16 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:16 2026-10-12 HKT</p><p>網上流傳，機場內一部加油車於周日（10月11日）濃煙滾滾，原因不明，有穿著反光衣人員持滅火筒戒備。機管局今日（10月12日）表示，當日下午約一時接報，指香港航煤供應加油有限公司一輛飛機加油車，於執勤完畢後、返回公司停車處途中突然冒煙。</p><p>機管局人員到場了解，未有發現火警，事件中無人受傷，濃煙亦已於短時間內散去。機場運作不受影響。機管局已要求相關公司交代事件起因。</p><img alt=\"涉事車輛為機場一部加油車。Threads：wa_khann\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5467da746f8003c2245c118a879a812/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-12-21h08m26s131.png\"/><img alt=\"事發時現場濃煙滾滾。Threads：wa_khann\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de66feee23913a8dc84502891d269f79/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-12-21h08m38s785.png\"/><img alt=\"事發時現場濃煙滾滾。Threads：wa_khann\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/046a4c11a974874f31a830da46a65b1b/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-12-21h08m52s672.png\"/><img alt=\"有穿著反光衣人員持滅火筒戒備。Threads：wa_khann\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61f2fe79203555e25fa335278041cbbb/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-12-21h08m45s167.png\"/><img alt=\"濃煙未幾散去。Threads：wa_khann\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b410ea8e6a16a7871c9cacbb07bf15ac/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-12-21h09m10s903.png\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T13:39:38.399695+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:16:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T15:18:17.668364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:37:43.301625+00:00","content_hash":"3c562dcea70905e38c3df72cd320c4de856f4a56b90a59e9df098164df0f1bfb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}